    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρπεδ-όεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
